{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Photo Outline Maker 是一款專注於照片去背與添加輪廓線的智能編輯工具，適合需要快速製作精美剪貼風格圖卡的用戶。該 App 提供豐富的去背效果與自定義邊框選項，能將人物、寵物或產品從背景中完美分離並加上多種風格的描邊。目前其終生版正進行<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>活動，原價為 US $19.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-208.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能去背與多元邊框設計</h2>\n<p>App 的核心功能在於一鍵精準去背，能有效保留髮絲等細節，並提供多達 132 種邊框樣式供選擇，涵蓋霓虹、星星、愛心等多種主題。用戶可自由調整邊框寬度、顏色及擴散程度，還能將處理後的主體疊加在漸層或純色背景上。此外，內建批處理模式讓用戶能一次隊列多張圖片自動處理，所有運算均在裝置端本地完成，確保隱私安全且不耗流量。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-77-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-78-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-79-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-80-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-30-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-31-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Photo Outline Maker: Editor 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Photo Outline Maker: Editor</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id6819720348\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:36:10.393688+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":507,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:23:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:54.516563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:29:32.942786+00:00","content_hash":"814d855457daf2f99bedbe751dd46304d4041790d4e623ed369d27166698bb19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}